   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Namibia Institute for Democracy (NID) project     support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Namibia Institute for Democracy (NID) intends to carry out a project  known as Supporting Electoral Law Reform and Civil Society Elections  Observation Capacity in Namibia. The NID can, jointly with the Law    Reform and Development Commission in Namibia, play a leading          facilitative role: arrange workshops, draft recommendations,inter-    action with government,strengthen civil society in election matters.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Namibia Institute for Democracy(NID) avser att genomf&#xf6;ra ett projekt  kallat Supporting Electoral Law Reform and Civil Society Elections    Observation Capacity in Namibia. NID kan, tillsammans med the Law     Reform and Development Commission in Namibia, ha en faciliator-roll;  ordna workshops, skriva rekommendationer, interaktion med landets     regering, st&#xe4;rka civila samh&#xe4;llet i valrelaterade &#xe4;renden.</narrative>
  </description>
